      "content": "hey i keep getting this weird burning feeling in the middle of my chest. its like a heavy pressure too. it usually happens when im walking up the stairs or being active but it goes away pretty quick if i just sit down for a bit. think it's just heartburn? should i just take some extra antacids to help it go down?",
