      "role": "user",
      "content": "i'm probably being too paranoid. i've had stomach issues for years so it's most likely just acid reflux acting up again. i don't really have time to go to the doctor for this right now, it's just a minor thing when i'm moving around. if i take a double dose of Tums or maybe some of that liquid Pepcid, would that be enough to clear it up? i just want to be able to walk without that feeling.",
